{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToCancelEffects","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every effect the store runs is already cancelled on teardown: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store\/cancelEffects()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the store’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" cancel all in-flight effect tasks. That is enough for cleanup, but it is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"all-or-nothing"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — you cannot cancel one specific effect while others keep running."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keyed cancellation adds that. You give an effect a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cancel id"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and later cancel every effect running under that id with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancel(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" effect or the imperative "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store\/cancel(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method. Identity lives outside the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Effect"},{"type":"text","text":" type — it is still a plain closure — so nothing about reducer signatures changes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reach for this when an effect outlives the action that started it: cancelling text-to-speech when the user skips, debouncing a search field, or tearing down a long-lived listener when a screen disappears.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Choosing-an-id","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Choosing an id"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A cancel id is any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable & Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" value. Distinct ids are independent; effects sharing an id are cancelled together. A dedicated empty type reads well and can’t collide with another feature’s id:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["private enum SearchID: Hashable, Sendable {}","private enum SpeechID: Hashable, Sendable {}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strings and enums work too — pick whatever is unambiguous in your domain."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Cancel-from-inside-a-reducer","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Cancel from inside a reducer"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Return "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to tag the work, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancel(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to stop it:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["case .startSpeaking(let text):","    return cancellable(id: SpeechID()) { send in","        for await word in speech.speak(text) {","            await send(.spokeWord(word))","        }","    }","","case .skip:","    \/\/ Stop any in-flight speech immediately.","    return cancel(id: SpeechID())"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the speaking effect is cancelled, its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for await"},{"type":"text","text":" loop ends at the next suspension point, exactly as it would on teardown."}]},{"anchor":"Debounce-with-cancelInFlight","text":"Debounce with `cancelInFlight`","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Passing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cancelInFlight: true"},{"type":"text","text":" cancels any effect already running under the id "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"type":"text","text":" starting the new one — the whole of debounce in one line:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["case .queryChanged(let query):","    return cancellable(id: SearchID(), cancelInFlight: true) { send in","        try await Task.sleep(for: .milliseconds(300))","        let results = try await api.search(query)","        await send(.results(results))","    }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each keystroke re-dispatches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".queryChanged"},{"type":"text","text":"; the new effect cancels the previous sleeping one, so only the last query in a burst reaches the network."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Cancel-from-view-or-scene-code","text":"Cancel from view or scene code","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When there is no reducer action to hang the cancellation on — a screen disappearing, a sheet dismissing — call ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store\/cancel(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" directly:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".onDisappear {","    store.cancel(id: SearchID())","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ids with nothing running are ignored, so it is always safe to call.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"What-it-does-not-replace","text":"What it does not replace","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keyed cancellation is not a substitute for resource cleanup. An effect holding a file handle, a network connection, or an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"text":" continuation should still release it — use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTaskCancellationHandler"},{"text":" or a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"defer"},{"text":". Cancellation ends the task; it does not close what the task opened.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Effects that terminate on their own (a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for await"},{"type":"text","text":" loop whose stream finishes) need no id at all. Only reach for a cancel id when something "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"else"}]},{"text":" has to stop the effect early.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/howtocanceleffects"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAPaywall","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAVersionKillswitch","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAParentalGate","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalytics","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddFeatureFlags","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddPersistence","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddICloudSync","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BuildingADomainPlugin","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/AgentSkill"],"title":"How-to Guides","anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Tag an effect with an identity so it can be cancelled later — by another effect, or imperatively from view code.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Cancel Effects"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddFeatureFlags":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddfeatureflags","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxFeatureFlags"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin into a Swidux app for typed feature flags, A\/B variants, and remote-tunable scalar values from a single JSON config."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddFeatureFlags","title":"Add Feature Flags","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddPersistence":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddpersistence","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Persist your domain entities to SwiftData with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" macro — no hand-written "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Model"},{"type":"text","text":" classes, database actors, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateWriter"},{"type":"text","text":" closures."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddPersistence","title":"Add Persistence","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/cancel(id:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancel(id:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"},{"text":" & ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Effect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux6Effecta"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/cancel(id:)","title":"cancel(id:)","abstract":[{"text":"An effect that cancels every in-flight effect running under ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddAPaywall":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddapaywall","abstract":[{"text":"Wire the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPaywall"},{"text":" plugin into a Swidux app to gate features behind a subscription or lifetime purchase.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAPaywall","title":"Add a Paywall","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddAParentalGate":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddaparentalgate","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gate sensitive actions — purchases, settings changes, leaving a kid-mode area — behind a math challenge."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAParentalGate","title":"Add a Parental Gate","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/Store/cancel(id:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/store\/cancel(id:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancels every in-flight effect tagged with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"id"},{"type":"text","text":" via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cancel"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"},{"kind":"text","text":" & "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store\/cancel(id:)","title":"cancel(id:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/AgentSkill":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/AgentSkill","role":"article","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/agentskill","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the bundled "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand."}],"type":"topic","title":"Using the Swidux Agent Skill"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/Effect":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Effect","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/effect","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An async unit of work returned by a reducer."}],"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Effect","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Effect","title":"Effect","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","title":"Swidux","role":"collection"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddAVersionKillswitch":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddaversionkillswitch","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire a remote-controlled blocker that prevents unsupported app versions from running, with an “Update” path back to the App Store."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAVersionKillswitch","title":"Add a Version Killswitch","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/Store/cancelEffects()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store\/cancelEffects()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cancelEffects"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/store\/canceleffects()","title":"cancelEffects()","abstract":[{"text":"Cancels all in-flight effects.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddAnalytics":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wire the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxAnalytics"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin into a Swidux app for centralized event tracking with declarative event mapping and auto-identify."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddAnalytics","title":"Add Analytics","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/HowToAddICloudSync":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddicloudsync","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer opt-in, cross-device iCloud sync on top of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":" with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxCloudKitSync"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin — including a runtime opt-out toggle, launch-time entitlement detection, and the Apple Developer portal configuration."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddICloudSync","title":"Add iCloud Sync","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/BuildingADomainPlugin":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/buildingadomainplugin","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a self-contained feature plugin with its own state, actions, and effects."}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BuildingADomainPlugin","title":"Building a Domain Plugin","role":"article"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/cancellable(id:cancelinflight:_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags an effect with a cancellation identity so it can later be cancelled by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancel(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store.cancel(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancellable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"},{"text":" & ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelInFlight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Effect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux6Effecta"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Effect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux6Effecta"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)","title":"cancellable(id:cancelInFlight:_:)","role":"symbol"}}}